														<r3d:remarks>The collection of the data in this database was supported by NSF Grant #0196217.
Starting in June 2016, KIT has integrated motion recordings from the CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database as a subset into the KIT Whole-Body Human Motion Database (https://motion-database.humanoids.kit.edu/). These motions can be found by filtering the list of motions for the &quot;Carnegie Mellon University (CMU)&quot; institution. The motion recordings are provided as C3D files and as the corresponding MMM representations.</r3d:remarks>
